  "full_text": "So, trying some image stabilization on my camera. Maybe we don't get miracles. Oh, no, no. God is smart enough. There's a bird. Wow. So, entertain God and your ass will follow. So, you think God has a record of what kind of database does God have on the world? Does God have a... You know, like what kind of image files? Does he have a 3D model of the universe? Like, what could you do with God's database? What will he permit? If you pay him, he will tell you stuff. But the question is, what do you pay him and what will he tell us? What if he gave me information about my caveman? Ancestors. Does that make any fucking sense? I don't know if that makes any sense. Because it branches back, you know, like the clan. The clan. What are the limits of God's animation? Honest to the core. Keep my commandment and live. My teaching is the apple of your eye. What is God looking for? He's looking for men and women whose hearts are completely his. Completely. God is not looking for magnificent specimens of humanity. He's looking for deeply spiritual, genuinely humble, honest to the core, servants who have integrity. You're full of shit. He's looking for excellent specimens of humanity. Are you fucking kidding me? He's like David, okay? Fuck you, man. Fucking David. He's not looking for pieces of shit. Today, we live in a world, it says, Anyways, if you can just make a good impression, that's all that matters. But you will never be a man or woman of God. If that's your philosophy. No. You can't fake it with the Almighty. He's not a... Okay, fuck. You know what we're gonna do? Fuck yeah. Good, fuck yeah. Uh-oh. So I got a fucked up knee, right? Banzai! Party foul. Okay. My knee felt pretty good. Jump the garbage again. No, no, no. Relax.",
